<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady/weak - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady/weak - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers slow, early sales both classes steady to weak. Demand light to moderate. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1150-1300 lbs 64.00-65.50, few 66.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1200 lbs 64.00-66.00.</p>
</text>
